{"id":"en_never-hire-relatives-as-housekeepers","title":"Never Hire Relatives as Housekeepers","titleEn":"Never Hire Relatives as Housekeepers","description":"Caroline Sterling has built a successful life, but trouble arrives when her mother, Diane Sterling, brings in someone they once knew, Brenda Jenkins, to work as a housekeeper. Brenda moves in with her daughter Jessica Jenkins, and the household quickly falls into disarray. The two wreck the home, destroy treasured possessions, take cash, invite men over, force open the safe, and in the end abduct Abby, demanding five million dollars for her return. Caroline keeps giving them second chances, yet each act of forgiveness is met with an even deeper betrayal. Ultimately, Brenda and Jessica are taken into custody for kidnapping and extortion. Diane comes to regret her decision, and calm returns at last.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/never-hire-relatives-as-housekeepers/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/never-hire-relatives-as-housekeepers/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Playing Dumb","Family Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dstay/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_never-hire-relatives-as-housekeepers_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dstay/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_never-hire-relatives-as-housekeepers_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dstay/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_never-hire-relatives-as-housekeepers_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/em